  "seoTitle": "Kombes Iman Imanuddin Dismissed By Police",
  "metaDescription": "Kombes Iman Imanuddin, a former Polda Metro Jaya official, has been dismissed from the police force for ethical violations involving case termination.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Kombes Iman Imanuddin was dismissed from the National Police following an ethics hearing.",
    "The official was found to have violated ethical codes by ordering the termination of a case investigation.",
    "Following his dismissal, the former Dirreskrimum Polda Metro Jaya official has submitted an appeal against the decision."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Kombes Iman Imanuddin, who previously served as the Director of General Criminal Investigation at Polda Metro Jaya, has been officially dismissed from the Indonesian National Police. The dismissal followed an internal ethics trial that investigated his professional conduct. According to reporting, the primary reason for his discharge was an ethical breach related to his intervention in a legal case, specifically regarding an improper order to stop a police investigation at the North Jakarta Metropolitan Police. While some reports initially referenced his involvement in other matters, sources clarified that the termination was strictly linked to the case handling procedure. In response to the decision reached by the ethics board, the former officer has initiated an appeal process to challenge his removal from the force. This development remains a subject of ongoing institutional review within the Indonesian law enforcement hierarchy.",
